[45.326751, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.055941ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[45.327653, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.845633ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.552812ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(1.350125ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.238382ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(2.387697ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.695732ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.066042ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
